      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly commend the veterinary doctors, technicians, and front desk receptionists for their welcoming, empathetic bedside manner. Pet parents frequently note that clinicians explain procedures in detail, though a couple of visitors noted firm enforcement of arrival policies."
      }
    },
    {
