      "title": {
        "en": "Lifesaving operations alongside procedural concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers credit the surgical team with saving pets through critical procedures like foreign body extractions and emergency pyometra surgeries. However, occasional clients reported dissatisfaction over post-vaccination reactions, unexpected fur shaving, or delayed prescriptions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Accessible pricing for veterinary procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe the clinic as an invaluable community resource providing accessible rates for pet care. Clients note that spay, neuter, and complex emergency surgeries cost significantly less than quotes from private emergency hospitals across the metropolitan area."
      }
    }
  ],
